{{also|jit|JIT|JİT}}
==Czech==
===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|cs}} {{m|sla-pro|*jьti||to go}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Cs-jít.ogg|audio|lang=cs}}

===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=i}}

# to [[walk]], [[go]] {{gloss|on foot}}
# to [[work]], [[do]], [[suffice]]
#: ''Budou tři stačit? — To '''půjde'''.'' - Will three be enough? - It'll do.
#: '''''Jde''' mi to.'' — ''I'm good at this.''
# to be possible
#: '''''Nejde''' udělat všechno dobře, ale udělat většinu dobře by už mohlo '''jít'''.''
# with the preposition '''o''': to [[concern]], [[matter]], [[interest]] {{gloss|to be at issue, to be at stake}}
#: '''''Jde o''' život.'' — ''There's a life at stake.''
#: ''Právě '''o''' to mi '''jde'''.'' — ''That's exactly what I'm concerned about.''

